---
title: Tomato and Egg Toast
tags:
  - tomato
  - egg
  - vegetarian
  - under-15-minutes
description: Crisp toast topped with a quick tomato and fried egg.
ingredients:
  - 2 slices of bread
  - 2 eggs
  - 1 ripe tomato, sliced
  - 1 teaspoon olive oil
  - Salt and black pepper
duration: 12
---

## Preparation

1. Toast the bread until golden.
2. Heat the olive oil in a pan. Fry the eggs to your liking and season with salt and pepper.
3. Divide the tomato slices between the toast, top with an egg, and serve.